{"query": "Psalm 23", "canonical": "Psalm 23", "parsed": [[19023001, 19023006]], "passage_meta": [{"canonical": "Psalm 23", "chapter_start": [19023001, 19023006], "chapter_end": [19023001, 19023006], "prev_verse": 19022031, "next_verse": 19024001, "prev_chapter": [19022001, 19022031], "next_chapter": [19024001, 19024010]}], "passages": ["<h2 class=\"extra_text\">Psalm 23 <small class=\"audio extra_text\">(<a class=\"mp3link\" href=\"https://audio.esv.org/david-cochran-heath/mq/19023001-19023006.mp3\" title=\"Psalm 23\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">Listen</a>)</small></h2>\n<h3 id=\"p19023001_01-1\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_01\" rel=\"v19023001\"></a>The <span class=\"divine-name\">Lord</span> Is My Shepherd</h3>\n<h4 id=\"p19023001_06-1\" class=\"psalm-title\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023001\"></a>A Psalm of David.</h4>\n<p class=\"block-indent\"><span class=\"begin-line-group\"></span>\n<span id=\"p19023001_06-1\" class=\"line\"><b class=\"chapter-num\" id=\"v19023001-1\">23:1&nbsp;</b><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023001\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;The LORD is my <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 78:52; Psalm 80:1; Isaiah 40:11; Jeremiah 31:10; Ezekiel 34:11\u201312; Ezekiel 34:23; John 10:11; Hebrews 13:20; 1 Peter 2:25; 1 Peter 5:4/\" title=\"Ps. 78:52; 80:1; Isa. 40:11; Jer. 31:10; Ezek. 34:11, 12, 23; John 10:11; Heb. 13:20; 1 Pet. 2:25; 5:4\">d</a></sup>shepherd; I shall not <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 34:9\u201310; Matthew 6:33/\" title=\"Ps. 34:9, 10; [Matt. 6:33]\">e</a></sup>want.</span><br /><span id=\"p19023002_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><b class=\"verse-num inline\" id=\"v19023002-1\">2&nbsp;</b><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023002\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;He makes me lie down in green <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Ezekiel 34:14; John 10:9/\" title=\"Ezek. 34:14; John 10:9\">f</a></sup>pastures.</span><br /><span id=\"p19023002_06-1\" class=\"line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023002\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;He leads me beside still waters.<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f1-1\" id=\"fb1-1\" title=\"&lt;note class=&quot;translation&quot; sub-class=&quot;original&quot;&gt;Hebrew &lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;catch-word&quot;&gt;beside&lt;/span&gt; waters of rest&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/note&gt;\">1</a></sup></span><br /><span id=\"p19023003_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><b class=\"verse-num inline\" id=\"v19023003-1\">3&nbsp;</b><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023003\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;He <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 19:7/\" title=\"Ps. 19:7\">g</a></sup>restores my soul.</span><br /><span id=\"p19023003_06-1\" class=\"line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023003\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;He <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 5:8; Psalm 31:3; Psalm 139:10; Psalm 139:24; Psalm 143:10; Isaiah 40:11; Isaiah 49:10/\" title=\"Ps. 5:8; 31:3; 139:10, 24; 143:10; Isa. 40:11; 49:10\">h</a></sup>leads me in <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Proverbs 4:11; Proverbs 8:20/\" title=\"Prov. 4:11; 8:20\">i</a></sup>paths of righteousness<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f2-1\" id=\"fb2-1\" title=\"&lt;note class=&quot;alternative&quot;&gt;Or &lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;catch-word&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; right paths&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/note&gt;\">2</a></sup></span><br /><span id=\"p19023003_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023003\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;for his <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 25:11; Psalm 31:3; Psalm 79:9; Psalm 109:21; Ezekiel 20:9; Ezekiel 20:14/\" title=\"Ps. 25:11; 31:3; 79:9; 109:21; Ezek. 20:9, 14\">j</a></sup>name\u2019s sake.</span><br /><span class=\"end-line-group\"></span>\n<span class=\"begin-line-group\"></span>\n<span id=\"p19023004_06-1\" class=\"line\"><b class=\"verse-num inline\" id=\"v19023004-1\">4&nbsp;</b><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023004\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;Even though I <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 138:7/\" title=\"Ps. 138:7\">k</a></sup>walk through the valley of <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Job 3:5/\" title=\"See Job 3:5\">l</a></sup>the shadow of death,<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f3-1\" id=\"fb3-1\" title=\"&lt;note class=&quot;alternative&quot;&gt;Or &lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;catch-word&quot;&gt;the valley of&lt;/span&gt; deep darkness&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/note&gt;\">3</a></sup></span><br /><span id=\"p19023004_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023004\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I will <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 3:6; Psalm 27:1; Psalm 27:3; Psalm 118:6/\" title=\"Ps. 3:6; 27:1, 3; 118:6\">m</a></sup>fear no evil,</span><br /><span id=\"p19023004_06-1\" class=\"line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023004\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;for <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Exodus 3:12; Isaiah 43:2/\" title=\"Ex. 3:12; Isa. 43:2\">n</a></sup>you are with me;</span><br /><span id=\"p19023004_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023004\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;your <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Micah 7:14/\" title=\"Mic. 7:14\">o</a></sup>rod and your staff,</span><br /><span id=\"p19023004_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023004\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;they comfort me.</span><br /><span class=\"end-line-group\"></span>\n<span class=\"begin-line-group\"></span>\n<span id=\"p19023005_06-1\" class=\"line\"><b class=\"verse-num inline\" id=\"v19023005-1\">5&nbsp;</b><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023005\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;You <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 78:19; Proverbs 9:2; John 6:51; 2 Samuel 17:27\u201329/\" title=\"Ps. 78:19; [Prov. 9:2; John 6:51]; See 2 Sam. 17:27-29\">p</a></sup>prepare a table before me</span><br /><span id=\"p19023005_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023005\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;in <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 31:19/\" title=\"[Ps. 31:19]\">q</a></sup>the presence of my enemies;</span><br /><span id=\"p19023005_06-1\" class=\"line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023005\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;you <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 45:7; Psalm 133:2; Luke 7:46; Psalm 92:10/\" title=\"Ps. 45:7; 133:2; Luke 7:46; [Ps. 92:10]\">r</a></sup>anoint my head with oil;</span><br /><span id=\"p19023005_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023005\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;my <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 16:5/\" title=\"Ps. 16:5\">s</a></sup>cup overflows.</span><br /><span id=\"p19023006_06-1\" class=\"line\"><b class=\"verse-num inline\" id=\"v19023006-1\">6&nbsp;</b><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023006\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;Surely<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f4-1\" id=\"fb4-1\" title=\"&lt;note class=&quot;alternative&quot;&gt;Or &lt;i&gt;Only&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/note&gt;\">4</a></sup> goodness and mercy<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f5-1\" id=\"fb5-1\" title=\"&lt;note class=&quot;alternative&quot;&gt;Or &lt;i&gt;steadfast love&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/note&gt;\">5</a></sup> shall follow me</span><br /><span id=\"p19023006_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023006\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;all the days of my life,</span><br /><span id=\"p19023006_06-1\" class=\"line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023006\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;and I shall <sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 27:4/\" title=\"Ps. 27:4\">t</a></sup>dwell<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f6-1\" id=\"fb6-1\" title=\"&lt;note class=&quot;alternative&quot;&gt;Or &lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;catch-word&quot;&gt;shall&lt;/span&gt; return to dwell&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/note&gt;\">6</a></sup> in the house of the LORD</span><br /><span id=\"p19023006_06-1\" class=\"indent line\"><a class=\"va\" alt=\"esv_06\" rel=\"v19023006\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<sup><a class=\"cf\" href=\"Psalm 21:4/\" title=\"Ps. 21:4\">u</a></sup>forever.<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f7-1\" id=\"fb7-1\" title=\"&lt;note class=&quot;translation&quot; sub-class=&quot;original&quot;&gt;Hebrew &lt;i&gt;for length of days&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/note&gt;\">7</a></sup></span><br /></p><span class=\"end-line-group\"></span>\n<div class=\"footnotes extra_text\">\n<h3>Footnotes</h3>\n<p><span class=\"footnote\"><a href=\"#fb1-1\" id=\"f1-1\">[1]</a></span> <span class=\"footnote-ref\">23:2</span> <note class=\"translation\" sub-class=\"original\">Hebrew <i><span class=\"catch-word\">beside</span> waters of rest</i></note>\n<br />\n<span class=\"footnote\"><a href=\"#fb2-1\" id=\"f2-1\">[2]</a></span> <span class=\"footnote-ref\">23:3</span> <note class=\"alternative\">Or <i><span class=\"catch-word\">in</span> right paths</i></note>\n<br />\n<span class=\"footnote\"><a href=\"#fb3-1\" id=\"f3-1\">[3]</a></span> <span class=\"footnote-ref\">23:4</span> <note class=\"alternative\">Or <i><span class=\"catch-word\">the valley of</span> deep darkness</i></note>\n<br />\n<span class=\"footnote\"><a href=\"#fb4-1\" id=\"f4-1\">[4]</a></span> <span class=\"footnote-ref\">23:6</span> <note class=\"alternative\">Or <i>Only</i></note>\n<br />\n<span class=\"footnote\"><a href=\"#fb5-1\" id=\"f5-1\">[5]</a></span> <span class=\"footnote-ref\">23:6</span> <note class=\"alternative\">Or <i>steadfast love</i></note>\n<br />\n<span class=\"footnote\"><a href=\"#fb6-1\" id=\"f6-1\">[6]</a></span> <span class=\"footnote-ref\">23:6</span> <note class=\"alternative\">Or <i><span class=\"catch-word\">shall</span> return to dwell</i></note>\n<br />\n<span class=\"footnote\"><a href=\"#fb7-1\" id=\"f7-1\">[7]</a></span> <span class=\"footnote-ref\">23:6</span> <note class=\"translation\" sub-class=\"original\">Hebrew <i>for length of days</i></note>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>(<a href=\"http://www.esv.org\" class=\"copyright\">ESV</a>)</p>"]}